      "answerKeyUrl": "https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3f8e59f4b2fe7c5705bf878bbd494ccdf/uploads/2026/04/20260420409057044.pdf",
      "locator": "4 April 2026, Shift 2, Q30, PDF page 11",
      "answer": "h = 2R",
      "correctOptionId": "6952781379",
      "verifiedAt": "2026-11-14T11:10:18+05:30",
      "adapted": true,
      "independentSolution": "g(h)/g0 = R²/(R+h)² = 1/9. Positive distances give R+h=3R, so h=2R. Direct check: GM/(3R)² = g0/9.",
      "sourceSha256": "2146491216c3ef79b210b8e4e4a2ed3c7afca1e9db198d4adcc23dd346cf5fc5"
    },
    {
      "id": "JEE-Main-2026-04-05-Shift-1-Paper1-QID-695278328",
      "sourceUrl": "https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3f8e59f4b2fe7c5705bf878bbd494ccdf/uploads/2026/04/20260409828731207.pdf",
      "answerKeyUrl": "https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3f8e59f4b2fe7c5705bf878bbd494ccdf/uploads/2026/04/20260420409057044.pdf",
      "locator": "5 April 2026, Shift 1, Q28, PDF page 10",
      "answer": "approximately 0.25% decrease",
      "correctOptionId": "6952781115",
      "verifiedAt": "2026-11-14T11:10:18+05:30",
      "adapted": true,
      "independentSolution": "Use the explicit uniform-density, nonrotating Earth model. At depth d, g/g0=1-d/R=0.9975. At height h, g/g0=1/(1+h/R)²=0.9950186877. Relative decrease from the initial below-surface value is 0.248753%, agreeing with 0.25%. Leading order is (2h-d)/R=0.0025. The model is stated in the adaptation; the real density profile differs.",
      "sourceSha256": "20a14808d521007d48289171297030a4ac18710abc180bb7e3b2d23e2a0a19fb"
    }
  ],
